# the USB host switch (0.15.9, the MIDI IN page's third knob): the port as the host of a USB-MIDI device (an MPC, a keyboard) through a
# powered hub; the simulator has no USB, so this checks the switch, its messages and that it is never kept (every power-on is a device)
seed 0
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 4
wait 100
expect fxpage 26
expect usbhost 0
spin K3 1
wait 200
expect usbhost 1
shot usb_host_on.png
spin K3 -1
wait 200
expect usbhost 0
spin K3 1
wait 200
expect usbhost 1
tap FX
tap PLAY
wait 5000
reboot
wait 3000
expect usbhost 0
